Package: titanprediction
Type: Project
Title: Patient-Level Molecular Prediction from TITAN Embeddings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Stefano", "Cacciatore", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "stefano.cacciatore@icgeb.org")
Description: Reproducible analysis pipeline for cancer-specific prediction of
    molecular, immune, genomic instability and fusion endpoints from frozen
    TITAN whole-slide embeddings using PLS regression and PLS-LDA.
